      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Idol: image to 3D Gaussian splat (TheLocalLab settings)\n\n[Idol](https://huggingface.co/speridlabs/idol) by Speridlabs turns one picture of an object into a 3D Gaussian splat, including the sides the picture never showed. It runs on ComfyUI's own TripoSplat nodes through [Nynxz/ComfyUI-Idol](https://github.com/Nynxz/ComfyUI-Idol) (Idol Preprocess Image, Idol Camera, Idol Prune Splat).\n\n### Settings in this workflow (tested: ~300 runs on an RTX A4500)\n- **Idol Preprocess Image mode: real.** It beat synthetic on photos and tied on renders / AI images, so it is never worse.\n- **KSampler: euler / simple, 30 steps, CFG 3.** CFG 3 matched or beat the default CFG 4 and keeps the hidden sides from bleaching out (CFG 4-5 paint the back of fur and skin pale). 30 steps looked the same as 50 and is ~35% faster.\n- Avoid: karras / exponential schedulers, ancestral and SDE samplers, uni_pc, fewer than 20 steps.\n- **Seed** mostly changes the unseen sides: if the back looks wrong, try 3-4 seeds.\n- **Idol Prune Splat** min_opacity 0.05 removes the faint haze; max_scale 0.05 also cuts needle spikes on the outline.\n- num_gaussians 262144 matches the model's detail; 65536 is a fast preview.\n\n### Best inputs\nOne whole, centred object on a simple background. Hard photos (fur, blurry background, dark light): clean them up first with the **MOSS Clean-up to 3D** workflow.\n\n### Models (folder)\n| File | Folder | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| `idol_fp16.safetensors` | `models/diffusion_models` | [nynxz/Idol](https://huggingface.co/nynxz/Idol) |\n| `idol_decoder_fp16.safetensors` | `models/vae` | [nynxz/Idol](https://huggingface.co/nynxz/Idol) |\n| `dino_v3_vit_h.safetensors` | `models/clip_vision` | [VAST-AI/TripoSplat](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSplat/tree/main/clip_vision) |\n| `flux2-vae.safetensors` | `models/vae` | [Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-4B](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Flux-2-Klein-4B/tree/main/split_files/vae) |\n| `birefnet.safetensors` | `models/background_removal` | [Comfy-Org/BiRefNet](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/tree/main/background_removal) |\n\nOutputs: the turntable video goes to `output/video/`, the `.ply` to `output/3d/` (open it in ComfyUI's 3D viewer or any splat viewer).\n"
      ],
      "title": "Idol"
    }
